Branch: master&lt;br/&gt;
Current Patch Set: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Commit: 01dec368182576a2199f96269429b0b103972ef4&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="497709" author="JIRAUSER19474" created="Fri, 10 Jul 2026 12:54:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patch abandoned.&#160; Code is correct. &#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reviewer correctly identified that the function returns with lock held by contract &#8212; callers do the&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; unlock. This patch would cause a double-unlock.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
